(
    title: "M.A.D.",
    description: Some("A Missile Command-style defence game. Your photon cannon sits at the bottom centre of the screen flanked by six energy stations, and enemy missiles stream in horizontally across the sky; when one turns white it dives for your base, and you must shoot it down before it lands. A two-player mode is unusual: one player works the cannon while the other steers some of the attackers, and the two swap roles after each round."),
